187:  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧩 Analysis chain</summary>\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n#!/bin/bash\n# Input 컴포넌트의 onBlur 타입 선언/사용 위치 확인\nrg -n -C2 \"onBlur\\\\?: \\\\(e: React\\\\.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>\\\\) => void|onBlur=\\\\{onBlur\\\\}\" src/core/components/input/Input.tsx\n```\n\nRepository: woowacourse/react-payments\n\nLength of output: 327\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\ncat -n src/core/components/input/Input.tsx\n```\n\nRepository: woowacourse/react-payments\n\nLength of output: 944\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n# Check how onBlur is used in the input element and if there are type issues\nrg -n \"onBlur\" src/core/components/input/Input.tsx -A 1 -B 1\n```\n\nRepository: woowacourse/react-payments\n\nLength of output: 409\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n# Search the codebase for other onBlur usages to see if different types are used elsewhere\nrg -n \"onBlur\" --type ts --type tsx | head -20\n```\n\nRepository: woowacourse/react-payments\n\nLength of output: 98\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n# Search for onBlur usages without the file type restriction\nrg -n \"onBlur\" src/core/components/input/ --type-list\n```\n\nRepository: woowacourse/react-payments\n\nLength of output: 460\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n# Look for Input component usage to see actual onBlur handler implementations\nrg -n \"onBlur=\" src/ -A 2 -B 2\n```\n\nRepository: woowacourse/react-payments\n\nLength of output: 1862\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n# Also check what React event types are available/imported\nrg -n \"React\\\\..*Event\" src/core/components/input/Input.tsx\n```\n\nRepository: woowacourse/react-payments\n\nLength of output: 200\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**`onBlur` 이벤트 타입을 `React.FocusEvent<HTMLInputElement>`로 수정하세요.**\n\n현재 11번 줄에서 `onBlur`가 `React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>`로 선언되어 있지만, blur 이벤트는 `React.FocusEvent<HTMLInputElement>`를 사용해야 합니다. `ChangeEvent`는 입력값 변경(onChange)에 사용되며, `FocusEvent`는 포커스 전환(onBlur/onFocus)에 사용됩니다. 현재 코드는 이벤트 매개변수를 사용하지 않아 런타임 오류는 없지만, 향후 이벤트의 `relatedTarget` 등의 속성을 사용할 경우 타입 오류가 발생할 것입니다.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@src/core/components/input/Input.tsx` around lines 10 - 11, 현재 Input 컴포넌트의\nonBlur prop 타입이 잘못되어 있으므로 onBlur의 타입을 React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>에서 포커스\n이벤트용인 React.FocusEvent<HTMLInputElement>로 변경하세요; Input.tsx에서 props 인터페이스 또는 해당\n선언부의 onBlur?: (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => void 를 찾아 onBlur?: (e:\nReact.FocusEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => void 로 수정하면 relatedTarget 등 FocusEvent 전용\n속성을 안전하게 사용할 수 있습니다.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk:db971e0c-c5ef-4643-8f85-94d730b4be84 -->\n\n<!-- 4e71b3a2 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
