194:  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**오류 상태를 보조기기에 전달할 수 있도록 속성을 보강해 주세요.**\n\nLine 18에서 시각 스타일만 변경되고 있어 스크린리더 사용자는 오류 상태를 인지하기 어렵습니다. `aria-invalid`(필요 시 `aria-describedby`)를 함께 반영해 접근성 신호를 맞춰주세요.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@src/core/components/input/Input.tsx` around lines 16 - 24, The input element\nonly updates visual styles for error state; update the JSX in the Input\ncomponent to emit accessibility attributes: add aria-invalid={isError} to the\n<input> and, if the component exposes or receives an error message id/prop (e.g.\nerrorId or errorMessageId), also set aria-describedby={errorId} when isError is\ntrue (fall back to undefined when not provided). Locate the <input> in Input.tsx\nand augment its props with aria-invalid and conditional aria-describedby tied to\nthe existing isError flag and any error id prop the component accepts.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk:db971e0c-c5ef-4643-8f85-94d730b4be84 -->\n\n<!-- 4e71b3a2 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
