222:  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_ | _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**Stylelint 규칙 위반으로 린트 실패 가능성이 있습니다.**\n\nLine 6 앞의 빈 줄 때문에 `declaration-empty-line-before` 에러가 발생합니다. 빈 줄을 제거해 주세요.\n\n \n\n<details>\n<summary>제안 diff</summary>\n\n```diff\n .payments {\n   display: flex;\n   flex-direction: column;\n   gap: 20px;\n-\n   max-width: 600px;\n   margin: auto;\n }\n```\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>\n\n> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**\n> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.\n\n```suggestion\n.payments {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 20px;\n  max-width: 600px;\n  margin: auto;\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_end -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧰 Tools</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🪛 Stylelint (17.9.0)</summary>\n\n[error] 6-6: Expected no empty line before declaration (declaration-empty-line-before)\n\n(declaration-empty-line-before)\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@src/pages/payments/Payments.module.css` around lines 5 - 6, 삭제할 빈 줄이 있어\ndeclaration-empty-line-before 스타일린트 규칙을 위반하고 있습니다; Payments.module.css에서 규칙 선언\n블록 내부의 \"max-width: 600px;\" 바로 앞에 있는 빈 줄을 제거하여 선언 전에 빈 줄이 없도록 수정하고, 파일의 해당 블록(예:\nthe rule containing \"max-width: 600px;\")에서 다른 선언들에도 동일한 빈 줄이 남아있지 않은지 확인하세요.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk:3f4e674f-5ff9-43dc-8add-4a83f56cc242 -->\n\n<!-- d98c2f50 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
