./_drafts/pr-raw/pr-523.txt:258:  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**CVC 입력을 비우지 못하는 경로가 있습니다.**\n\n현재 조건식 때문에 `''`(삭제 상태)가 차단되어 사용자가 CVC를 지우기 어렵습니다. 또한 blur 핸들러의 `preventCvc(cvc)` 호출은 반환값을 사용하지 않아 의미가 없습니다.\n\n<details>\n<summary>수정 방향 예시</summary>\n\n```diff\n-const preventCvc = (cvc: string) => {\n-  if (!isNumericString(cvc)) return false;\n-  if (cvc.length > 3) return false;\n-  return true;\n-};\n+const preventCvc = (value: string) => {\n+  if (value === '') return false;\n+  if (!isNumericString(value)) return true;\n+  if (value.length > 3) return true;\n+  return false;\n+};\n\n const handleChangeCvc = (value: string) => {\n-  if (!preventCvc(value)) return;\n+  if (preventCvc(value)) return;\n   setCvc(value);\n };\n\n const handleBlurCvc = () => {\n-  preventCvc(cvc);\n   setOnBlurCvc(true);\n };\n```\n</details>\n\n\n\n\nAlso applies to: 125-127\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@src/pages/payments/Payments.tsx` around lines 108 - 123, preventCvc currently\nblocks the empty string and thus prevents users from clearing the CVC; also a\ncall to preventCvc in the blur handler is unused. Update preventCvc to\nexplicitly allow '' and otherwise enforce isNumericString(value) and\nvalue.length <= 3; keep handleChangeCvc using preventCvc to gate setCvc. Remove\nthe meaningless call to preventCvc from any onBlur handler (or use its boolean\nresult if the blur logic needs it) so onBlurCvc/renderErrorMessageCvc and\nvalidateCvc can handle empty-value validation/display correctly.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:medusa:grasshopper:67e66621-4774-4e43-87e7-c8b23edd26d7 -->\n\n<!-- 4e71b3a2 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
./_drafts/pr-raw/pr-523.txt:363:  "body": "P3;\n\nCreditCardInfo 데이터 단위로 값을 받는건 어떻게 생각하시나요?\n`<CreditCard info={creditCardInfo} />`\n\n위 4개의 값이 대부분 같이 사용 될 것 같아서에요.\n\n추가로 `cardBrand={renderBrandCard(cardNumbers)}`는 사용하는 쪽에서 처리해도 되지 않을까 하는 생각이 있어요.",
./_drafts/pr-raw/pr-507.txt:38:      "body": "**Actionable comments posted: 12**\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧹 Nitpick comments (2)</summary><blockquote>\n\n<details>\n<summary>.storybook/preview.tsx (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`21-26`: _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**스토리북 데코레이터에 앱 전역 스타일 동기화를 검토해 주세요.**\n\nLine 23-25는 `ThemeProvider`만 적용되어, 실제 앱(`src/App.tsx`)의 `Global` 스타일과 렌더링 조건이 달라집니다. 입력/버튼 기본 스타일이나 배경이 달라져 스토리 검증 신뢰도가 떨어질 수 있어요. `globalStyles`도 함께 주입하는 방향을 확인해 보시면 좋겠습니다.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn @.storybook/preview.tsx around lines 21 - 26, The Storybook decorator\ncurrently wraps stories with ThemeProvider (ThemeProvider, theme, Story) but\nomits the app's global styles; import and apply the app's global style export\n(e.g. globalStyles or GlobalStyles from your src/styles or where src/App.tsx\ndefines it) inside the same decorator so the global CSS is injected for each\nstory — call the globalStyles() function (or render <GlobalStyles />) together\nwith ThemeProvider before rendering <Story /> to ensure inputs, buttons,\nbackground and other base styles match the real app.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>src/hooks/useExpiryDate.tsx (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`7-14`: **문자열 배열을 튜플 타입으로 변경하여 만료일 상태의 타입 안전성을 개선하세요.**\n\nLine 7과 `cardStausTypes.ts`에서 `string[]` 대신 `[string, string]` 튜플 타입으로 선언하면, 인덱스 범위가 0과 1로 명시적으로 제한되어 의도치 않은 인덱스 접근을 타입 레벨에서 방지할 수 있습니다. 실제 사용 패턴이 월(0)과 연도(1)만 사용하므로 이 변경이 적절합니다.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@src/hooks/useExpiryDate.tsx` around lines 7 - 14, Change the card expiry\nstate from a loose string[] to a fixed tuple [string, string] for type safety:\nupdate the useState declaration for cardExpiryDate / setCardExpiryDate to use\n[string, string] and adjust any related variables (like the local next in\nhandleCardExpiryDate) so they are typed as [string, string] as well; ensure code\nthat reads/writes index 0 and 1 (month and year) remains unchanged and update\nany related type exports/imports in cardStausTypes.ts to reflect the tuple type.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for all review comments with AI agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nInline comments:\nIn `@docs/index.html`:\n- Line 2: The docs HTML root element currently uses lang=\"en\" which conflicts\nwith the Korean content; update the <html> tag's lang attribute in\ndocs/index.html to match the project's root index.html (e.g., change lang=\"en\"\nto lang=\"ko\") so the document language setting is consistent across the site.\n\nIn `@index.html`:\n- Line 2: 문서의 루트 <html> 태그에 하드코딩된 lang=\"en\" 설정으로 한국어 UI의 접근성·음성 읽기 품질이 낮으니 루트\n<html> 태그의 lang 속성을 서비스 기본 언어에 맞게 ko로 변경하거나 서비스 언어 변수(예: appLocale, locale 등)가\n있다면 해당 값으로 동적으로 설정하도록 수정하세요; 대상 식별자는 루트 html 태그와 lang 속성입니다.\n\nIn `@README.md`:\n- Around line 8-22: Add a new CVC requirement under the 기능 요구사항: create a \"CVC\n입력 규칙\" subsection that specifies numeric-only input, allowed lengths (3 digits\nfor Visa/MasterCard, 4 for AMEX), real-time validation feedback on invalid\nlength or non-digit characters, and that the 실시간 프리뷰 업데이트 should reflect masked\nCVC input; place this adjacent to the existing \"카드 번호 입력 및 식별\" and \"카드 유효기간 입력\"\nheadings so implementers working on those features (card number identification,\nexpiry input, and preview update) can find and enforce the CVC rules.\n\nIn `@src/components/CardCvc.tsx`:\n- Around line 21-31: In CardCvc (component CardCvc.tsx) the label element and\ninput element are not associated which harms accessibility; update the label to\ninclude an htmlFor attribute and the input to include a matching id (generate a\nstable unique id if the component can be instantiated mu