e parent; update handleValidityPeriodBlur to call padValidityPeriodUnit, pass\nthe padded value into validityPeriodChange, check its return and only call\nonChange when validation succeeded.\n\nIn `@src/components/InputField.tsx`:\n- Around line 22-31: The Label element in the InputField component is currently\na plain label that isn’t associated with any specific input, breaking\naccessibility for the grouped inputs; change the markup so the group title is\nprovided as a fieldset/legend or via aria-labelledby: wrap InputWrapper and the\ninput list with a <fieldset> and render the group text as a <legend> (replace\nthe Label node), or keep a non-label styled element and generate a stable id\n(e.g., groupLabelId) that you pass as aria-labelledby on each Input in\ninputPropsList; update InputField to set that id and ensure each Input receives\nthe aria-labelledby prop so screen readers correctly associate the group label\nwith all inputs (referencing InputField, Label, InputWrapper, inputPropsList,\nand Input).\n\nIn `@src/components/SwitchCase.tsx`:\n- Around line 12-17: The component currently wraps the resolved node in a div\nand loses falsy ReactNodes; update SwitchCase to return the matched node\ndirectly instead of rendering <div>. Locate the computed caseComponent (variable\ncaseComponent in SwitchCase) and replace the JSX return with a direct return\nthat preserves falsy values by selecting caseComponent when it is defined,\notherwise defaultCase (e.g., use an undefined check: return caseComponent !==\nundefined ? caseComponent : defaultCase). Ensure you remove the wrapper div so\nvalues like 0, '' or null passed as defaultCase are preserved as-is.\n\nIn `@src/pages/AddNewCardPage.tsx`:\n- Around line 67-71: CardInfoForm is declared as a styled.form but has no submit\nhandler, causing Enter to trigger page submission/refresh; either add an\nonSubmit handler where CardInfoForm is rendered (e.g., in the AddNewCardPage\ncomponent) that calls event.preventDefault(