./_drafts/pr-raw/pr-515.txt:127:  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**폼 기본 제출 동작을 막아 주세요.**\n\nLine 64의 `<form>`은 `onSubmit` 처리 없이 렌더링되어, 입력 중 Enter 키로 페이지가 새로고침되어 상태가 유실될 수 있습니다.\n\n<details>\n<summary>수정 예시</summary>\n\n```diff\n-        <form css={formLayout}>\n+        <form\n+          css={formLayout}\n+          onSubmit={(event) => {\n+            event.preventDefault();\n+          }}\n+        >\n```\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>\n\n> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**\n> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.\n\n```suggestion\n        <form\n          css={formLayout}\n          onSubmit={(event) => {\n            event.preventDefault();\n          }}\n        >\n          <CardNumbersField value={formValue.cardNumbers.value} onUpdated={handleCardNumbersUpdate} />\n          <ExpirationPeriodField value={formValue.expirationPeriod.value} onUpdated={handleExpirationPeriodUpdate} />\n          <CVCField value={formValue.cvc.value} onUpdated={handleCVCUpdate} />\n        </form>\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_end -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@src/pages/AddCardPage.tsx` around lines 64 - 68, The form in AddCardPage.tsx\nlacks an onSubmit handler so pressing Enter will trigger a native submit and\nreload the page; add an onSubmit prop to the <form> (the element that wraps\nCardNumbersField, ExpirationPeriodField, CVCField) that calls\nevent.preventDefault() (and optionally delegates to your existing submit logic\nif any) to stop the browser's default submit/refresh behavior; implement the\nhandler as a local function (e.g., handleFormSubmit) and pass it to the form